{"sym":"ENQ.L","v":2,"about":{"summary":"EnQuest PLC, an oil and gas production and development company, explores, extracts, and produces hydrocarbons in the North Sea and Malaysia. The company primarily holds interests in the Magnus, Kraken, Golden Eagle, Scolty/Crathes, Greater Kittiwake Area, and Alba, as well as PM8/Seligi projects. It also offers manpower and contracting/procurement services. In addition, the company engages in the marketing and trading of crude oil; leasing activities; and assessment and development of new energy and decarbonization opportunities. EnQuest PLC was incorporated in 2010 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","lead":"EnQuest PLC, an oil and gas production and development company, explores, extracts, and produces hydrocarbons in the North Sea and Malaysia. The company primarily holds interests in the Magnus, Kraken, Golden Eagle, Scolty/Crathes, Greater Kittiwake Area, and Alba, as well as PM8/Seligi projects.","web":"https://www.enquest.com","emp":719,"city":"London","country":"United Kingdom"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Amjad Adnan Bseisu","t":"Chief Executive & Executive Director","age":62,"yb":1963,"pay":1151000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Dr. Jonathan Michael Copus","t":"CFO & Executive Director","age":53,"yb":1972,"pay":774000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Craig Baxter","t":"Head of Investor Relations & Corporate Affairs","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Paul Massie","t":"Legal & Commercial Director","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ian Wood","t":"Head of Communications & Reporting","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Claire Scrimgeour","t":"Human Resources Director","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Kathryn Anna Christ","t":"Company Secretary","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ian McKimmie","t":"General Manager of North Sea","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Radzif Ahmed","t":"General Manager of South East Asia","fy":2025}],"gov":{"audit":7,"board":4,"comp":5,"rights":1,"overall":4,"d":"2026-10-01"},"own":{"ins":18.19,"inst":60.37,"inst_float":73.8,"inst_n":50},"funds":[{"n":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International